<html>
<head>
	<title></title>
</head>
<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Hi {{{Recipient.Name}}},<br />
&nbsp;
<p style="line-height:1.38"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">I received confirmation today that your ads are live and running successfully! We are already seeing impressions and clicks which is a great sign. That said, we want to set the expectation that Google campaigns may take some time to level out, so you may notice a bit of an adjustment period. On our first monthly call, we will review the performance of your Google ads for the first month so we can make adjustments if needed.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
&nbsp;

<p style="line-height:1.38"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">I also wanted to share your login information for TapClicks dashboard. You can use this dashboard to track your ad spend budget and other performance data. We will review this dashboard together during our first check-in in 2 weeks.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
&nbsp;

<p style="line-height:1.38"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Please let me know if you have any questions, otherwise I look forward to connecting with you in a few weeks! </span></span></span></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Thanks and have a great day,</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="line-height:1.38"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">{{{Sender.Name}}} </span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
<br />
&nbsp;</body>
</html>